{"id":"67d233485b83a728","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-kdnfextension.md","title":"Bounded-width patterns decide bounded-DNF extensions","display":"thm-kdnfextension — Bounded-width patterns decide bounded-DNF extensions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-kdnfextension","aliases":["27-thm-kdnfextension"],"display":"thm-kdnfextension — Bounded-width patterns decide bounded-DNF extensions","depends_on":["[[27-df-pattern]]","[[27-df-litset]]","[[27-df-extension]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.3.3 Lemma 12.3 and Theorem 12.11","source_printed_pages":"535","source_pdf_pages":"559","verification_status":"source-algorithm-and-cover-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-kdnfextension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-kdnfextension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kdnfextension — Bounded-width patterns decide bounded-DNF extensions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b4178d75957ed66\" href=\"?note=5b4178d75957ed66\" title=\"27-df-pattern\">27-df-pattern</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.3.3 Lemma 12.3 and Theorem 12.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"535"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"559"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-algorithm-and-cover-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_n,\\mathrm{Pat},\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_n,\\mathrm{Pat},\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5b4178d75957ed66\" href=\"?note=5b4178d75957ed66\" title=\"27-df-pattern\">27-df-pattern</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_k(n)\">\\(\\mathcal F_k(n)\\)</span> 由下式定义。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\cap F=\\emptyset\">\\(T\\cap F=\\emptyset\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_k(n)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\mid\nD\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_n,\\ \\forall U\\in D\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(U)|\\le k)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F_k(n)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\mid\nD\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_n,\\ \\forall U\\in D\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(U)|\\le k)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\cap\\mathcal F_k(n)\\ne\\emptyset\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in T\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{Pat}(T,F)\\;\n(U(a)=1\\land|\\mathrm{Lits}(U)|\\le k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\cap\\mathcal F_k(n)\\ne\\emptyset\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in T\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{Pat}(T,F)\\;\n(U(a)=1\\land|\\mathrm{Lits}(U)|\\le k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Lemma 12.3、Theorem 12.11，印刷 p.535／PDF p.559。逐个真样本a枚举其n个满足文字中至多k个的子集，测试每项是否避开全部F。每个a找到一项时把它们析取就是k-DNF扩张；反向从任意k-DNF扩张选覆盖a的一项即是模式。候选数至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{j=0}^{\\min(k,n)}\\binom nj\">\\(\\sum_{j=0}^{\\min(k,n)}\\binom nj\\)</span>，故固定k为多项式；没有把k作为输入时也称多项式。T为空用空DNF；F为空时空项可用。此类是存在k-DNF，非一般函数的最大素项长度。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pattern]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$、$k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$。$\\mathrm{Term}_n,\\mathrm{Pat},\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。$\\mathcal F_k(n)$ 由下式定义。 $T\\cap F=\\emptyset$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$、$k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$。$\\mathrm{Term}_n,\\mathrm{Pat},\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。$\\mathcal F_k(n)$ 由下式定义。 $T\\cap F=\\emptyset$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$、$k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$。$\\mathrm{Term}_n,\\mathrm{Pat},\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。$\\mathcal F_k(n)$ 由下式定义。 $T\\cap F=\\emptyset$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_n,\\mathrm{Pat},\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lits}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_k(n)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\cap F=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_k(n)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\mid\nD\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_n,\\ \\forall U\\in D\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(U)|\\le k)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\cap\\mathcal F_k(n)\\ne\\emptyset\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in T\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{Pat}(T,F)\\;\n(U(a)=1\\land|\\mathrm{Lits}(U)|\\le k).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sum_{j=0}^{\\min(k,n)}\\binom nj","display":false}],"bytes":1917,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-kdnfextension|thm-kdnfextension — Bounded-width patterns decide bounded-DNF extensions]]"}],"outgoing":["5b4178d75957ed66","8311e93eaac6c631","2080bf803b294b75"]}